   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"rtl\"><div style=\"text-align:right\">אהלן,<br><br>יש לי בעיה בקריאת קובץ ג&#39;ייסון שמכיל אותיות בעברית.<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">require</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;RJSONIO&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)==</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;RJSONIO&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>str</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;  {<br>    &quot;driverId&quot;: 1412320810720,<br>    &quot;userId&quot;: &quot;Joseph&quot;,</span><span style=\"color:#080\"><br>    &quot;candidateId&quot;: 0,<br>    &quot;iterationNum&quot;: 0,<br>    &quot;address&quot;: &quot;רמון 14, תל אביב יפו, ישראל&quot;,<br>    &quot;rimp&quot;: 1,<br>    &quot;placeAccuracy&quot;: 50.0<br>  }&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>json</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fromJSON</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">str</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">encoding</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;UTF-8&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#008\">print</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">json</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></div></code></div><br>הפלט שיוצא הוא<br><div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:13px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:15px;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(225,226,229)\"><pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline-style:none;outline-width:initial;outline-color:initial;border-top-style:none;border-right-style:none;border-bottom-style:none;border-left-style:none;border-width:initial;border-color:initial;white-space:pre-wrap!important;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\">driverId userId candidateId iterationNum\r\n1 1.412321e+12 Joseph           0            0\r\n                                                                                                                                                    address\r\n1 &lt;U+05E8&gt;&lt;U+05DE&gt;&lt;U+05D5&gt;&lt;U+05DF&gt; 14, &lt;U+05EA&gt;&lt;U+05DC&gt; &lt;U+05D0&gt;&lt;U+05D1&gt;&lt;U+05D9&gt;&lt;U+05D1&gt; &lt;U+05D9&gt;&lt;U+05E4&gt;&lt;U+05D5&gt;, &lt;U+05D9&gt;&lt;U+05E9&gt;&lt;U+05E8&gt;&lt;U+05D0&gt;&lt;U+05DC&gt;\r\n  rimp placeAccuracy\r\n1    1            50</pre></span></div><br><br>ניסיתי לשחק עם חבילות ג&#39;ייסון אחרות ועם אנקודינג אחר, ללא הצלחה...<br>ראיתי שאלות דומות פה:<br><a href=\"http://r.789695.n4.nabble.com/Encoding-problem-I-fails-to-read-Hebrew-text-from-online-td3076272.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r.789695.n4.nabble.com/Encoding-problem-I-fails-to-read-Hebrew-text-from-online-td3076272.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497594042000&amp;usg=AOvVaw34nKCjkqv-dJxcYglzgh6v\">http://r.789695.n4.nabble.com/Encoding-problem-I-fails-to-read-Hebrew-text-from-online-td3076272.html</a><br>ופה:<br><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/25446141/r-3-1-1-32-bit-htmlparse-mess-up-hebrew-texts-os-win-7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/25446141/r-3-1-1-32-bit-htmlparse-mess-up-hebrew-texts-os-win-7&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497594042000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0rjbfAKj4Z8ap7Sg969jdY\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/25446141/r-3-1-1-32-bit-htmlparse-mess-up-hebrew-texts-os-win-7</a><br><br>אבל לא הצלחתי לפתור את הבעיה. מישהו מכיר ויודע איך נפטרים מההמרה של אותיות בעברית?<br><br>תודה!<br>עמרי<br></div></div>"
